This is Anchor, the file manager for the GNOME desktop.

Installation
============

See the 'INSTALL' file for installation instructions.  You will need a
complete and up-to-date GNOME development environment to build anchor.
You can also find some building and installation tips at
https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Anchor/Development/Anchor

Hacking on Anchor
===================

Please see the HACKING file for information about hacking on anchor.

Mailing List
============

The anchor mailing list is anchor-list@gnome.org.  Subscription
information is available at
http://mail.gnome.org/mailman/listinfo/anchor-list

How to report bugs
==================

Bugs should be reported to the GNOME bug tracking system
(http://bugzilla.gnome.org), in the "anchor" product.

Please read the following page on how to prepare a useful bug report:
http://bugzilla.gnome.org/bug-HOWTO.html

